Z||000000||Fiero5||10-04-2001||02:19 PM||||I added a few new touches of the dash area. Steering wheel, light switches and so forth.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/interior2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/interior1_2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/interior3.jpg"> <P>I have been talking to Gargoyle86 (Bob Schlag-president of MAFOA) on his interior, and took some of those ideas and spent the last few days spiffing up on Fiero9.<P>Steve||||reg||6
Z||000001||My7Fieros||10-04-2001||02:55 PM|||| I really like that! Where did you get the steering wheel done? Looks great!<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="blue"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I><p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 10-04-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000002||Fiero5||10-04-2001||03:56 PM||||I actually did the steering wheel myself. A local leather goods shop has a spray dye for leather that is available in different colors. I masked off the parts of the wheel I didn't want colored red, and sprayed away.<P>Now I think I will do something similar to my Fiero1. The top section of that leather steering wheel would look awesome in white, like Bob's Gargoyle wheel is but his is red.<P>Steve||||reg||6
